00:26:38.280 --> 00:26:39.960
Like, they couldn't be, like, blue and pink.

683
00:26:40.320 --> 00:26:44.060
So he did eventually find them at a place called Hollywood Costumes.

684
00:26:44.340 --> 00:26:47.540
He was particularly proud of the tiny sunglasses that he found.

