1509
01:03:34.710 --> 01:03:35.910
That was so beautiful.

1510
01:03:36.410 --> 01:03:36.750
I'm sorry.

1511
01:03:37.070 --> 01:03:38.130
That was so beautiful.

1512
01:03:38.130 --> 01:03:40.970
