1534
01:04:28.990 --> 01:04:29.590
I know.

1535
01:04:29.770 --> 01:04:32.990
She goes up to my man and lays one on him.

1536
01:04:33.050 --> 01:04:33.530
She does.

1537
01:04:34.010 --> 01:04:37.770
