1545
01:04:52.310 --> 01:04:52.790
Wow.

1546
01:04:53.110 --> 01:04:53.490
Yes.

1547
01:04:53.750 --> 01:04:55.550
Angela loses it.

1548
01:04:56.030 --> 01:04:56.830
Loses it.

