She's left the party, and now I have some stuff to tell you guys about this scene.

1551
01:05:03.970 --> 01:05:04.020
Oh, yeah.

1552
01:05:04.630 --> 01:05:05.110
All right.

1553
01:05:05.330 --> 01:05:06.850
20 minutes, 16 seconds.

1554
01:05:07.130 --> 01:05:09.490
The ultimate Angela pissed-offness has happened.

1555
01:05:10.090 --> 01:05:11.830
