1577
01:06:01.630 --> 01:06:03.390
Michael has ruined Christmas.

1578
01:06:03.910 --> 01:06:05.730
Kelly has kissed my man.

1579
01:06:05.950 --> 01:06:08.530
Ryan is the king of the party planning committee.

1580
01:06:08.790 --> 01:06:09.350
Ah!

1581
01:06:09.690 --> 01:06:09.970
Right?

1582
01:06:10.130 --> 01:06:10.410
Yes.

1583
01:06:10.490 --> 01:06:14.430
He said, I want you to take these ornaments and just throw them and shatter them.

1584
01:06:14.590 --> 01:06:17.270
