1658
01:08:28.750 --> 01:08:32.650
One of my favorite scenes is when Angela screams and smashes the glass ornaments.

1659
01:08:32.750 --> 01:08:34.590
What was it like to film?

1660
01:08:34.990 --> 01:08:35.930
All of that.

1661
01:08:36.110 --> 01:08:36.410
Yes.

1662
01:08:36.790 --> 01:08:37.190
Exactly.

1663
01:08:37.510 --> 01:08:41.530
But now if you go back and watch the scene, you guys, watch the first two that I threw.

1664
01:08:41.770 --> 01:08:43.590
I think that's kind of from the first take.

1665
01:08:43.590 --> 01:08:44.970
They bounce straight up.

