And this is that moment where you're like, Michael has been just such a jerk this whole episode.

1671
01:09:02.790 --> 01:09:08.450
And then you see this sort of sad, wounded person that just wants people to like him.

1672
01:09:08.570 --> 01:09:08.810
Yes.

1673
01:09:08.890 --> 01:09:11.950
How much he needs people to invite him to have drinks.

1674
01:09:12.130 --> 01:09:13.170
Like he needs it.

1675
