01:09:58.630 --> 01:09:59.070
Sure.

1692
01:09:59.370 --> 01:10:00.110
Something like that.

1693
01:10:00.110 --> 01:10:02.930
It has to be sound that is, what do they call that?

1694
01:10:03.050 --> 01:10:04.250
Like a live sound.

1695
01:10:04.270 --> 01:10:05.030
Active, a live sound.

1696
01:10:05.030 --> 01:10:05.270
Yeah.

1697
01:10:05.370 --> 01:10:05.970
Something like that.

1698
01:10:06.050 --> 01:10:06.650
Active sound.

1699
01:10:06.870 --> 01:10:07.310
Yeah.

