Yes.

1707
01:10:22.330 --> 01:10:28.290
And another fan favorite is, Yankee Swap is like Machiavelli meets Christmas.

1708
01:10:28.770 --> 01:10:33.870
And I really do want you guys to check out the DVD deleted scenes from this episode.

1709
01:10:34.050 --> 01:10:35.830
By the way, we're not getting paid to say that.

1710
01:10:36.010 --> 01:10:36.450
We're not.

1711
01:10:36.670 --> 01:10:37.170
We just really think they're good.

1712
01:10:37.330 --> 01:10:38.430
We just really think they're good.

